  76:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Egtm/Atom/Pwm/IfxEgtm_Atom_Pwm.c ****              * resolution, it is necessary to perform a synchronous update (via CLSi_ATOM_CHx_CTRL_
