  80:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Egtm/Atom/Pwm/IfxEgtm_Atom_Pwm.c ****              * CLSi_ATOM_CHx_CTRL.CLK_SRC will be immediately updated with the clock source value s
  81:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Egtm/Atom/Pwm/IfxEgtm_Atom_Pwm.c ****              * register. Afterwards once the channel is enabled, the channel will operate on the se
  82:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Egtm/Atom/Pwm/IfxEgtm_Atom_Pwm.c ****              * the value read from the register CLSi_ATOM_CHx_CTRL.CLK_SRC reflects the actual sele
