 514:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 515:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \retval uint32 Counter value. 0 to 0x7FFFFFFF.
